  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement the intent of RSA 485-A:1 to protect drinking water supplies, surface waters, and groundwater by specifying the procedures and criteria for obtaining permits required by RSA 485-A:17.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
